// dungeon feature '>'."; then '\r' and ' ' are quitchars which `force` swallows
// (getpos.c:1131-1140), each re-arming autodescribe for "unexplored area (no
// travel path)"; ESC finally aborts.  The one-read stand-in printed nothing for
// any of them and handed keys 189-191 back to rhack as commands.
